	skos:definition "A value before or after a change that is an object, with any keys." ;
	skos:inScheme nist_nvd:nvd_history ;
	skos:note "NVD's file allows a string, an array or an object as a value, and states nothing of the object's keys. The 1,335 values of the three pages read on 2026-11-03 are all strings, so no key is named here, and LinkML's Pydantic generator, which ignores extra_slots, would refuse an object." .
